    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "school_main_chara_headteacher_01",
      "hash64": "F190C0E6B5D96E32",
      "text": "Si vous éprouvez des difficultés à l’école,\\nn’hésitez pas à me solliciter.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "school_main_chara_headteacher_02",
      "hash64": "F190BFE6B5D96C7F",
      "text": "Je suis absolument ravi que vous ayez intégré\\nnotre établissement.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "school_main_chara_battleteacher_01",
      "hash64": "FCF05F98B306ACEA",
      "text": "Yo ! Ça va, l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A09)]e nouveaua nouvelle ? Tu ne trouves pas ça\\ngénial, les muscles ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "school_main_chara_battleteacher_02",
      "hash64": "FCF05E98B306AB37",
      "text": "Yo ! Ça va, l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A09)]e nouveaua nouvelle ? Tu continues\\nà t’entraîner régulièrement, j’espère ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "school_main_chara_mathteacher_01",
      "hash64": "1F03A89EE640703E",
      "text": "Tiens, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Surtout, n’hésite pas\\nà me demander, si tu as la moindre question.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "school_main_chara_mathteacher_02",
      "hash64": "1F03A79EE6406E8B",
      "text": "Oh, tiens, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Tu as l’air en forme.\\nComme je suis contente ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_01",
      "hash64": "E27F498E75633814",
      "text": "Tu te rends compte du temps précieux que\\ntu gâches à venir discuter avec moi ?![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_02",
      "hash64": "E27F4C8E75633D2D",
      "text": "Je dois avouer que t’es un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e élève\\nplutôt fascinant[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_03",
      "hash64": "E27F4B8E75633B7A",
      "text": "Je poursuis mes recherches sur le conte dont\\nje te parlais. Je te tiendrai au courant.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_04",
      "hash64": "E27F468E756332FB",
      "text": "Si le sujet t’intéresse, j’espère que tu partiras\\nà la recherche des trésors du fléau ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_05",
      "hash64": "E27F458E75633148",
      "text": "Les trésors du fléau se portent bien ?\\c\\nSi t’arrives pas à les gérer, je serais ravie de\\nt’en débarrasser ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_01",
      "hash64": "AD66439216327F3E",
      "text": "Si jamais tu es fatigué[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, n’hésite pas à faire\\nune petite sieste à l’infirmerie.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_02",
      "hash64": "AD66429216327D8B",
      "text": "Hé, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Ne te démène pas trop !\\nC’est aussi important de se reposer, tu sais ![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_01",
      "hash64": "1E92750EDE0E0DFB",
      "text": "Oh, ne fais pas attention à moi, et profite\\nde cet espace comme bon te semblera.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_02",
      "hash64": "1E92760EDE0E0FAE",
      "text": "Si tu connais un commerce de friandises\\nde bon aloi, surtout, fais-le-moi savoir.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0608EFBD7D0DCC30",
      "text": "Salut, salut ! J’espère que tu as réussi à attraper\\nde nombreux Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_02",
      "hash64": "0608F2BD7D0DD149",
      "text": "Essaie d’enregistrer au moins 30 espèces\\nde Pokémon dans ton Pokédex !\\c\\nReviens me voir, quand tu auras réussi ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_03",
      "hash64": "0608F1BD7D0DCF96",
      "text": "Essaie d’enregistrer au moins 100 espèces\\nde Pokémon dans ton Pokédex !\\c\\nReviens me voir, quand tu auras réussi ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
